Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我开始给你按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是第一次来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我第一次来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你身上有没有感觉什么地方很累
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我全身都很累
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你做全身按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.08,0:02:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,先按摩背部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.73,0:02:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体好僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你看起来很累
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我慢慢给你按摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体很僵硬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,经常有人告诉我 我的下半身也很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,腰下面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,常有人说很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我会按顺序慢慢给你按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,请按摩下半部分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.89,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你身体的这个部位很僵硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你再往下一点按摩就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是在这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉很舒服 但是再往下面一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下面一点就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也太硬了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:04:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我能脱掉内裤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.11,0:04:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得太紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 这种事情是不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.53,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请继续穿好你的内裤 这是我们的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 请继续穿你着的内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,身体渐渐暖和起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,变得热起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我的身体越来越暖和了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,疼痛在能忍受的范围之内吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我下面感觉很酸痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤太紧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我多按摩一下屁股吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我臀部的肌肉经常用到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屁股很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很僵硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是这附近吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,请再往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着我的内裤按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,请再往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,穿着这个有点碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请您稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不穿的好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请继续穿好你的内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不穿内裤比较舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最近我的胃一直很难受\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你能按摩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那能请您仰卧让我做腹部按摩吗\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胃一直很僵硬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胃很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你涂点油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 请看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你闻起来也很香
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的胃 是在这附近吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请再往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你能往下一点按摩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,请再低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩只能做到这一步
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了\N是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我这里很僵硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,摸这里的行为 在我们店是不允许的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但我这里真的很僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啊\N能拜托你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我能脱掉内裤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我憋不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里不是那种店  所以很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因为小姐你太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,变成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鸡巴很僵硬哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请稍等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.87,0:09:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把内裤穿上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,裤子太紧了我不想穿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想穿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这不是妓院
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你能摸一下我的鸡巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 你能先把内裤穿上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我的鸡巴太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,所以穿不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这很为难 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这里卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.27,0:10:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你能摸一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,能麻烦你把内裤穿上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,被卡住了 穿不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 穿不进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要把它变小
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.47,0:10:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很为难 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你给我这里按摩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里真的不是那种店
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把内裤穿上吗 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,要把鸡巴弄小点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请摸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.91,0:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很为难的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我憋不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,请摸一次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.01,0:11:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 不行不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请摸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我很为难
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果鸡巴变小就能穿进去了\N等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我很为难啊客人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鸡巴太大 所以穿不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.79,0:11:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你能把手伸出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是穿不起进去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以拜托你了\N等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很为难
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 你没见过这么大的鸡巴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,被人总说我的鸡巴很大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的没见过这么大的鸡巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你和这么的鸡巴做过爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.79,0:12:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.74,0:12:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我很会做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们做爱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,多摸摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.04,0:12:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,多摸摸我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.93,0:12:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话穿不进去的 所以多摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再多做做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了多摸摸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里不是那种店
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你要多做一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你要适可而止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,都是因为你我才这么硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你给我按摩了我才这么兴奋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你也想舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.39,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底打算做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,确实这么大了 就不能穿内裤了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,穿不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你变得很积极了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过好几次这么大的鸡巴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.31,0:14:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我很会做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这么给我打飞机我可不会射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.32,0:14:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我是寸止高手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体开始在颤抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这样能忍住吗 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会屈服在你的手淫下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是颤抖得很厉害吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,寸止高手 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是寸止高手 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.14,0:14:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你是寸止高手 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会射的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们一起做一些更舒服的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的臀部动的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,变得好硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.19,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你是寸止高手 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是寸止高手 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个巧合
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,精液出来了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是寸止高手 对吗\N我一直都很能忍的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.53,0:16:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这么撸的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.54,0:16:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.12,0:16:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你很敏感 早泄了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经射了但是还很硬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你又要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.75,0:16:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你还很硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,让我休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让你休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.77,0:17:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续按摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请轻点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你全身都很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这里怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里也变硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有感觉到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乳头很硬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乳头越来越硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴又变硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你全身都在颤抖呢 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.70,0:19:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽 好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用憋着了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,请释放你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.61,0:20:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴很调皮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.59,0:20:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你自己的鸡巴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.36,0:20:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.12,0:20:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你还可以射出来很多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都射出来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.77,0:21:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.47,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的马眼张的很大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.05,0:21:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那么喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,射了射了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.53,0:21:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来 射出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.24,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你射了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.77,0:22:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你还可以射出更多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不是还一柱擎天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还是很硬呢 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你全部射出来就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你还可以射出更多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不能再射了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是很硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.05,0:23:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,客人  您没有完全寸止住哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:24:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你更舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过请对店里保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,舔的我好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.87,0:24:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.89,0:24:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.58,0:25:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,口交和打飞机哪个更舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.61,0:25:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢这个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.16,0:26:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.05,0:26:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直勃起着呢 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.71,0:26:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这么喜欢这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.28,0:26:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你还可以射出很多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想射更多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我的口交很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.76,0:27:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你想射在我嘴里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想要
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服 好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.99,0:27:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,请再用力含
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙 不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.41,0:27:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙 不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.61,0:28:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.18,0:28:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你想射在我嘴里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.37,0:28:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.56,0:28:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.28,0:28:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能射在我嘴里哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,射了射了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.60,0:28:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 好厉害 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.82,0:28:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,射更多出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.89,0:28:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  不行\N可以射更多出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.39,0:28:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.79,0:28:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 还有哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗 舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.17,0:28:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.87,0:28:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.82,0:29:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多啊 客人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.19,0:29:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你在发抖呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.62,0:29:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就可以穿内裤了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.26,0:29:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你清醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.50,0:29:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.23,0:30:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.60,0:30:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,客人 这是你第一次来这样的店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始我给你按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.39,0:31:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要用这种油按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.79,0:31:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,客户你好敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.95,0:31:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体在发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.10,0:31:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我会为你服务的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.45,0:32:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你全身都很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.80,0:32:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乳头很硬
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.87,0:33:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我会轻轻给你按摩 同时排出你的淋巴系统
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乳头太硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.97,0:33:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 你想亲我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.30,0:36:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乳头变非常硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.84,0:36:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.72,0:36:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样舔你乳头怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.07,0:36:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你在发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.07,0:37:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,已经碰到硬硬的东西喽
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.18,0:37:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你能感觉到我在抚摸你的胸部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样 舒服吗-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.79,0:38:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这附近怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.45,0:38:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你又在发抖了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.19,0:39:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,即使从内裤上看 我都知道你的鸡巴变得非常大呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.53,0:39:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.31,0:39:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.55,0:39:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我能看看这根硬梆梆的鸡巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好大的鸡巴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.90,0:40:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,硬梆梆的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.15,0:40:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次看到这么大的鸡巴
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我在鸡巴周围按摩 这样你的鸡巴就会变硬
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.86,0:40:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,更好的血液循环会让你的鸡巴更硬
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.49,0:40:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.66,0:41:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 你只在看我的胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.36,0:41:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你那么想看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.82,0:41:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要我给你看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.41,0:42:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸部怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.28,0:42:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,兴奋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.03,0:42:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你想用我的胸部乳交
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.78,0:43:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸部夹的舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你再仔细看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.25,0:43:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你变得很硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.47,0:44:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.30,0:44:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴好硬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太下流了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.58,0:44:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你的腰动起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.58,0:44:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡巴越来越大了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.12,0:44:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这里舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.67,0:44:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你感觉很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.71,0:44:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你在发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.27,0:45:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我能让我的乳头摩擦你的鸡巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.94,0:45:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是太敏感了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.27,0:45:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个乳头怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.25,0:45:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡巴硬梆梆的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.65,0:45:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想射在我奶子上吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.62,0:46:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.40,0:46:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,请更舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.52,0:46:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.77,0:46:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.16,0:46:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦，射给我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,射给我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.24,0:46:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.75,0:46:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多精液出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.79,0:46:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多热热的精液
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.56,0:47:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你射了好多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.90,0:47:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 你还能射吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.68,0:47:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来我用我的嘴为你服务吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.67,0:47:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴还是这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.87,0:47:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的口交舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.18,0:48:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要变得更舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.76,0:49:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,比刚才变得更硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.69,0:49:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我好喜欢这根大鸡巴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.38,0:50:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以射很多出来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.92,0:50:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请更舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.65,0:51:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你热热的精液
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.24,0:51:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你又射了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.24,0:51:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我知道你还可以射更多出来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.08,0:51:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你想射更多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.64,0:51:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,摸我的大奶子
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.33,0:52:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.24,0:52:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢我的胸部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.16,0:52:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.88,0:53:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看看我的屁股吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.54,0:53:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相舔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.60,0:53:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细看看我的小骚逼
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.97,0:53:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以任意的摸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.46,0:54:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.23,0:55:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你弄的好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.74,0:55:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我的骚逼很舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.22,0:55:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会让你的鸡巴舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.99,0:55:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.39,0:55:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.08,0:55:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.16,0:56:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.49,0:56:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡巴也变得舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.03,0:56:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你想射吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.19,0:56:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.68,0:56:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,全部射出来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.08,0:57:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你又射了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.83,0:57:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还能再射吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.42,0:57:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.34,0:57:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,鸡巴可以插进我的小骚逼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.33,0:58:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,只是摩擦能感觉到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.45,0:58:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.61,0:59:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你的鸡巴放进去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.15,0:59:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.47,1:00:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.99,1:00:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看到在干我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.08,1:00:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细看
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.60,1:00:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鸡巴干的我好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.34,1:01:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你想射了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.71,1:01:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,先别射
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.34,1:01:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能射在里面哦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.33,1:01:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你又要再射一次吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.84,1:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你比以前抖的更厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.87,1:01:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你想再射一次吗 可以哦
