Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.02,1:14:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.05,1:14:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.83,1:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,疼不疼
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.06,1:14:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,非常的好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.04,1:15:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗 疼不疼
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.82,1:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.40,1:15:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就继续
