Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.71,1:16:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.97,1:17:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.50,1:17:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.83,1:17:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,疼不疼
